{%- case field -%}
{%- when 'group' -%}wellness
{%- when 'wellness' -%}
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Anyone with dry &amp; dehydrated skin<br> Anyone searching for a natural winter massage oil<br> Anyone who likes the fragrance of roses<br> Someone dealing with strawberry legs</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Almond Oil, Coconut Oil, Cinnamon Sticks, Rose Petals, Aloe Vera Leaves, Rose Infused Oil, Vitamin E, Lavender Infused Oil, Geranium Infused Oil, Orange Infused Oil.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>The best oil for dry skin, Nava is a special abhyanga blend that will hydrate the skin. It is best used before the shower as it will retain moisture in the skin and prevent dryness.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>We source organic roses from the farms of Assam that are infused in coldpressed oils at our facility. This oil is uniquely prepared to hydrate the skin and elevate its moisture content.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
{%- endcase -%}
